// Deployment pipeline, run by the Jenkins of a yggdrasil installation. Replace <application-id>
// with this application's id in that installation's catalog.yaml.
//
// All the logic lives in yggdrasil's shared library; what deploys where comes from the catalog:
// pushes to branches that an environment's `branches` match deploy there, and a green
// release/x.y.z -> main pull request deploys to every release environment in order, then is merged
// and tagged vx.y.z. Build and test stay in GitHub Actions; this file only deploys.

@Library('yggdrasil') _

yggdrasilPipeline(stack: '<application-id>')
